msgid "Check-in and Check-out policy question"
msgstr "What are the check-in and check-out times?"

msgid "Check-in and Check-out policy answer"
msgstr ""
"Check-in starts at 14:00 and check-out is until 12:00. Early check-in or "
"late check-out is available upon request with our 24/7 front desk subject to"
" room availability."

msgid "Breakfast included question"
msgstr ""
"Is breakfast included in the room rate and what are the serving hours?"

msgid "Breakfast included answer"
msgstr ""
"Yes, a lavish buffet breakfast is complimentary for all room categories at "
"Deluxe Hotel. Breakfast is served daily from 07:00 to 10:30 in our main "
"restaurant or delivered to your room."

msgid "Accepted payment methods question"
msgstr "What payment methods are accepted?"

msgid "Accepted payment methods answer"
msgstr ""
"We accept all major payment systems: UzCard, Humo, Visa, MasterCard, cash "
"upon arrival, as well as mobile payments via Payme and Click."

msgid "Airport transfer order question"
msgstr "How can I arrange an airport or railway transfer?"

msgid "Airport transfer order answer"
msgstr ""
"Our hotel operates an executive fleet (Mercedes E-Class, VIP Minivans). You "
"can order a transfer via our online modal or inform reception of your flight"
" details for a personal pickup."

msgid "Children accommodation policy question"
msgstr "What is the policy for children staying at the hotel?"

msgid "Children accommodation policy answer"
msgstr ""
"Children under 6 stay free of charge when sharing existing bedding. "
"Complimentary baby cots are also available upon request."

msgid "Cancellation policy question"
msgstr "What is the cancellation policy?"

msgid "Cancellation policy answer"
msgstr ""
"Free cancellation is available up to 24 hours prior to scheduled arrival "
"with 100% refund or free date modification."

